---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Krishna's Knowledge Journal">

  <Section
    title="Privacy Policy"
    description="How Krishna's Knowledge Journal handles information and privacy."
  >

    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how Krishna's Knowledge Journal
      ("the Journal", "we", "us", or "our") handles information when
      you visit and use this website.
    </p>

    <h2>Information collected</h2>

    <p>
      Krishna's Knowledge Journal does not currently require visitors
      to create an account or submit personal information to read
      articles and use the website.
    </p>

    <p>
      Like most websites, technical information may be processed as
      part of delivering and securing the website, such as IP address,
      browser information, device information, requested pages, and
      basic request information.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>

    <p>
      The Journal may use Google AdSense and other advertising
      technologies in the future. When advertising is enabled, Google
      and its advertising partners may use cookies, web beacons,
      IP addresses, or similar technologies to provide, measure,
      and personalize advertising.
    </p>

    <p>
      Third parties may place and read cookies on your browser or use
      similar technologies as a result of advertising being displayed
      on this website.
    </p>

    <p>
      For information about how Google uses data when you use sites
      that partner with Google, see
      <a
        href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services
      </a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy choices and consent</h2>

    <p>
      Where required by applicable law, visitors may be asked to
      provide consent before certain cookies, local storage, or
      advertising technologies are used.
    </p>

    <p>
      For visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom,
      and Switzerland, Google may require a certified consent
      management platform when personalized advertising is served.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>

    <p>
      The website may rely on third-party services for hosting,
      deployment, content management, search, security, analytics,
      advertising, or other website functionality. Those services
      may process technical or other information according to their
      own privacy policies.
    </p>

    <h2>External links</h2>

    <p>
      Articles and pages on this website may contain links to external
      websites. Krishna's Knowledge Journal is not responsible for the
      privacy practices or content of those external websites.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>

    <p>
      This Privacy Policy may be updated when the website's
      functionality, services, or legal requirements change.
      The latest version will always be published on this page.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Last updated:</strong> September 24, 2026
    </p>

  </Section>

</BaseLayout>